  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Universal Health Coverage</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norad will work with FolkeHelse Institutt to support WHO, the World Bank and other key partners to develope knowledge and supporting implementation of UNIVERSAL HEALTH COVERAGE in the poorest countries (special focus on SS Africa)</narrative>
  </description>
